OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785975492
OL,3,CPeter Duncan calls for approval of
OL,4,C'life-changing' prostate cancer
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,FTV presenter Peter Duncan has called
OL,8,Ffor a "life-changing" and minimally-
OL,9,Finvasive prostate cancer treatment to
OL,10,Fbe accessible across the UK.
OL,12,FThe 72-year-old actor and broadcaster,
OL,13,Fknown for hosting Blue Peter in the
OL,14,F1980s, revealed his prostate cancer
OL,15,Fdiagnosis in 2019 and subsequently
OL,16,Funderwent focal therapy.
OL,26,@pD@GOUpD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
