PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785975492
OL,3,CPeter Duncan calls for approval of
OL,4,C'life-changing' prostate cancer
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,FThe treatment destroys only the
OL,8,Fcancerous part of the prostate, and
OL,9,Fstudies have proven it successfully
OL,10,Fdelivers long-term outcomes for
OL,11,Fpatients with minimal side effects.
OL,13,FA recent report by researchers at
OL,14,FImperial College London and Imperial
OL,15,FCollege Healthcare Trust also found
OL,16,Fthat focal therapy is as effective as
OL,17,Fradiotherapy and prostatectomy surgery.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785975492
OL,3,CPeter Duncan calls for approval of
OL,4,C'life-changing' prostate cancer
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,FProstate Cancer UK has encouraged the
OL,8,FNational Institute for Health and Care
OL,9,FExcellence (Nice) to review the latest
OL,10,Fevidence about the treatment as it
OL,11,Femphasises the importance of making it
OL,12,Fwidely available.
OL,14,FDuncan has backed the charity in its
OL,15,Flatest move as he reflected on how
OL,16,Ffocal therapy was a "complete success"
OL,17,Ffor him.
OL,26,@xD@UOUxD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
