PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785975492
OL,3,CPeter Duncan calls for approval of
OL,4,C'life-changing' prostate cancer
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,FHe said: "I was originally offered a
OL,8,Fradical prostatectomy which would have
OL,9,Fremoved the whole prostate, but I was
OL,10,Flucky enough to be treated with focal
OL,11,Ftherapy which was better for me and a
OL,12,Fless invasive option.
OL,14,F"It was a complete success, and I've
OL,15,Fonly experienced very minor after-
OL,16,Feffects, allowing me to continue with
OL,17,Fmy life as before.
OL,19,F"But as it stands, many men aren't
OL,20,Fgiven the same chance I was, and that
OL,21,Fneeds to change.
OL,26,@oD@JOUvD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785975492
OL,3,CPeter Duncan calls for approval of
OL,4,C'life-changing' prostate cancer
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,F"That's why I'm backing Prostate
OL,8,FCancer UK's calls for Nice to review
OL,9,Fnew evidence and make sure thousands
OL,10,Fof men across the UK can access these
OL,11,Flife-changing treatments."
OL,13,FDuncan is among many famous faces to
OL,14,Fhave accessed focal therapy such as TV
OL,15,Fpresenter Jeremy Clarkson and former
OL,16,Fprime minister Lord David Cameron.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785975492
OL,3,CPeter Duncan calls for approval of
OL,4,C'life-changing' prostate cancer
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,FFocal therapy leads to a five-fold
OL,8,Flower risk of side effects such as
OL,9,Fincontinence, erectile dysfunction and
OL,10,Frectal problems compared to
OL,11,Ftraditional radiotherapy or surgery
OL,12,Fbecause it only targets the areas of
OL,13,Fcancer.
OL,15,FAmy Rylance, director of health
OL,16,Fservices, equity and improvement at
OL,17,FProstate Cancer UK, said: "Without a
OL,18,Ftimeline from Nice, we simply don't
OL,19,Fknow how long men will have to wait
OL,20,Ffor approval on the NHS.
OL,26,@yD@[OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785975492
OL,3,CPeter Duncan calls for approval of
OL,4,C'life-changing' prostate cancer
OL,5,Ctreatment
OL,7,F"The sad truth is that until then
OL,8,Fthousands of men will have to deal
OL,9,Fwith life-changing side effects simply
OL,10,Fbecause of their postcode.
OL,12,F"That's completely unacceptable, which
OL,13,Fis why we're calling for an urgent
OL,14,Freview of these treatments."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUvD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
